<h3 class="fadeInUp animatable">Cardiac Cath Lab</h3>
<p class="fadeInUp animatable">At our dedicated Paediatric Cardiac Catheterisation Laboratory we focus solely on providing safe, precise and minimally invasive heart care for children. Every part of the setup is designed with young patients in mind from advanced imaging systems to a specialist paediatric cardiac team that works with the highest level of accuracy. Our aim is to diagnose problems early, treat them with confidence and support each child through a smoother faster recovery. Every patient receives care shaped around their age, condition and long-term heart health.</p>
<div class="workup-sec mt-3">
<h4 class="py-3 fadeInUp animatable">What We Offer for Children</h4>
<ul class="listing-apps">
<li class="fadeInUp animatable first_class">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Diagnostic Cardiac Catheterisation</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>A gentle minimally invasive way to study a child’s heart. It helps us understand how the heart is structured, how it functions and how blood flows through it. This allows us to identify both congenital and acquired heart conditions with great clarity.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Interventional Paediatric Cardiology</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>Treatments such as balloon angioplasty, stent placement and repairing structural defects are carried out through tiny entry points, which avoids open-heart surgery in most cases and makes recovery far easier for children.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable speciality_banner_no"><img class="img-fluid speciality_banner" src="/upload/fileManager/specialise_banner/CardiacCathLab.png"></li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div>
<h5>Specialised Paediatric Cardiac Procedures</h5>
</div>
<div class="mb-2">
<p>We offer advanced care for infants and children including device closure of atrial or ventricular septal defects, balloon dilatation for narrowed valves or vessels and procedures for complex congenital heart issues.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Electrophysiology and Ablation for Children</h5>
</div>
<p>We evaluate and treat abnormal heart rhythms using catheter-based mapping and ablation therapy which helps restore a steady rhythm safely and effectively.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Emergency Paediatric Cardiac Care</h5>
</div>
<p>Swift action is vital in critical moments. Our team provides rapid diagnosis and stabilisation for children facing acute cardiac conditions ensuring immediate expert support.</p>
</li>
<li class="fadeInUp animatable">
<div class="mb-2">
<h5>Recovery and Follow-up for Children</h5>
</div>
<p>After every procedure, we offer a carefully guided recovery plan with close monitoring, clear rehabilitation advice and long-term follow-up to help each child stay well as they grow.</p>
</li>
</ul>
